== Summary ==
Patch 9.0.2 ''Shadowlands'' content patch.
* TOC: <code>90002</code>
* Diffs: [https://github.com/Gethe/wow-ui-source/compare/e0b5e2dfd18e9767ee792ef530feeb0b19a31367..13daf5957f148b83ef6e6d7f68e0ceee59686221 wow-ui-source], [https://github.com/Ketho/BlizzardInterfaceResources/commit/bf666c9eb1699118b6ec386e9194a02e3f407b89 BlizzardInterfaceResources]

== Notable changes ==
* Help frame overhaul
* {{api|DeleteCursorItem}} now requires a hardware event
* ''Shadowlands'' feature additions

Most significant changes took place in 9.0.1. See [[Patch 9.0.1/API changes]] for more information.

